{"seq":1,"slug":"solidity-fundamentals","title":"Solidity 语言基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/fintech-fundamentals/smart-contracts/solidity-fundamentals","wordCount":805,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"solidity-语言基础\">Solidity 语言基础</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Solidity 是以太坊智能合约的主要编程语言，一种面向合约的、静态类型的高级语言，编译后运行在 EVM（以太坊虚拟机）上。它的语法受 JavaScript、Python 和 C++ 影响，但其执行模型与传统编程语言有本质区别——每一步计算都需要消耗 Gas，且所有状态变更都是全局可见且不可逆的。</p>\n<p>对于有传统编程经验的开发者来说，Solidity 最大的范式转换在于：代码即法律（Code is Law），一旦部署就无法修改；每个操作都有经济成本；合约间的交互涉及复杂的安全考量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Solidity 源代码 .sol] --&gt; B[solc 编译器]&#10;    B --&gt; C[ABI 接口定义]&#10;    B --&gt; D[字节码 Bytecode]&#10;    D --&gt; E[部署交易]&#10;    E --&gt; F[EVM 执行]&#10;    F --&gt; G[合约账户创建]&#10;    G --&gt; H[合约地址]&#10;    C --&gt; I[前端/后端调用]&#10;    I --&gt; H\">graph TD\n    A[Solidity 源代码 .sol] --&gt; B[solc 编译器]\n    B --&gt; C[ABI 接口定义]\n    B --&gt; D[字节码 Bytecode]\n    D --&gt; E[部署交易]\n    E --&gt; F[EVM 执行]\n    F --&gt; G[合约账户创建]\n    G --&gt; H[合约地址]\n    C --&gt; I[前端/后端调用]\n    I --&gt; H</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Solidity</th>\n<th>TypeScript</th>\n<th>Rust</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型系统</td>\n<td>静态强类型</td>\n<td>静态可选类型</td>\n<td>静态强类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行环境</td>\n<td>EVM 虚拟机</td>\n<td>V8/Node.js</td>\n<td>原生/WASM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存模型</td>\n<td>Storage/Memory/Calldata</td>\n<td>堆/栈/GC</td>\n<td>所有权系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误处理</td>\n<td>require/revert/assert</td>\n<td>try/catch</td>\n<td>Result/Option</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>继承</td>\n<td>多继承（C3 线性化）</td>\n<td>无（接口+组合）</td>\n<td>无（Trait）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经济模型</td>\n<td>Gas 费用</td>\n<td>免费执行</td>\n<td>免费执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可变性</td>\n<td>部署后不可修改</td>\n<td>随时更新</td>\n<td>随时更新</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"数据类型与存储位置\">数据类型与存储位置</h2><p>Solidity 的数据类型分为值类型和引用类型。值类型在赋值时复制，引用类型则需要显式指定存储位置（storage、memory 或 calldata）。理解存储位置对于优化 Gas 消耗至关重要。</p>\n<p><strong>Storage</strong> 是合约的永久存储，数据写入区块链状态树，成本最高（写入 20,000 Gas，修改 5,000 Gas）。<strong>Memory</strong> 是函数执行期间的临时内存，调用结束后释放。<strong>Calldata</strong> 是只读的调用数据区域，仅用于外部函数参数，Gas 消耗最低。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT&#10;pragma solidity ^0.8.20;&#10;&#10;contract DataTypes {&#10;    uint256 public totalSupply;&#10;    mapping(address =&gt; uint256) public balances;&#10;    address[] public holders;&#10;&#10;    struct TokenInfo {&#10;        string name;&#10;        string symbol;&#10;        uint8 decimals;&#10;        uint256 maxSupply;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    TokenInfo public tokenInfo;&#10;&#10;    enum OrderStatus { Pending, Filled, Cancelled }&#10;&#10;    event Transfer(address indexed from, address indexed to, uint256 value);&#10;&#10;    function transfer(address to, uint256 amount) external {&#10;        require(balances[msg.sender] &gt;= amount, &quot;Insufficient balance&quot;);&#10;        require(to != address(0), &quot;Invalid recipient&quot;);&#10;&#10;        unchecked {&#10;            balances[msg.sender] -= amount;&#10;            balances[to] += amount;&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        emit Transfer(msg.sender, to, amount);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function batchTransfer(&#10;        address[] calldata recipients,&#10;        uint256[] calldata amounts&#10;    ) external {&#10;        require(recipients.length == amounts.length, &quot;Length mismatch&quot;);&#10;&#10;        uint256 totalAmount;&#10;        for (uint256 i; i &lt; amounts.length; ) {&#10;            totalAmount += amounts[i];&#10;            unchecked { ++i; }&#10;        }&#10;        require(balances[msg.sender] &gt;= totalAmount, &quot;Insufficient balance&quot;);&#10;&#10;        for (uint256 i; i &lt; recipients.length; ) {&#10;            balances[msg.sender] -= amounts[i];&#10;            balances[recipients[i]] += amounts[i];&#10;            emit Transfer(msg.sender, recipients[i], amounts[i]);&#10;            unchecked { ++i; }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pragma solidity ^0.8.20;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract DataTypes {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint256 public totalSupply;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mapping(address => uint256) public balances;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    address[] public holders;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    struct TokenInfo {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        string name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        string symbol;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint8 decimals;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 maxSupply;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    TokenInfo public tokenInfo;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    enum OrderStatus { Pending, Filled, Cancelled }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    event Transfer(address indexed from, address indexed to, uint256 value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function transfer(address to, uint256 amount) external {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(balances[msg.sender] >= amount, \"Insufficient balance\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(to != address(0), \"Invalid recipient\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        unchecked {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            balances[msg.sender] -= amount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            balances[to] += amount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        emit Transfer(msg.sender, to, amount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function batchTransfer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        address[] calldata recipients,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256[] calldata amounts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) external {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(recipients.length == amounts.length, \"Length mismatch\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 totalAmount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for (uint256 i; i &#x3C; amounts.length; ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            totalAmount += amounts[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            unchecked { ++i; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(balances[msg.sender] >= totalAmount, \"Insufficient balance\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for (uint256 i; i &#x3C; recipients.length; ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            balances[msg.sender] -= amounts[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            balances[recipients[i]] += amounts[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            emit Transfer(msg.sender, recipients[i], amounts[i]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            unchecked { ++i; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>存储位置</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n<th>Gas 成本</th>\n<th>可写性</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>storage</td>\n<td>永久</td>\n<td>极高（SSTORE 20000）</td>\n<td>可读写</td>\n<td>合约状态变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>memory</td>\n<td>函数调用期间</td>\n<td>中（按字节计费）</td>\n<td>可读写</td>\n<td>局部复杂类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>calldata</td>\n<td>函数调用期间</td>\n<td>低（只读无复制）</td>\n<td>只读</td>\n<td>外部函数参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>stack</td>\n<td>当前操作</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>可读写</td>\n<td>值类型局部变量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"函数修饰符与访问控制\">函数修饰符与访问控制</h2><p>Solidity 通过可见性修饰符（public、external、internal、private）和自定义 modifier 实现细粒度的访问控制。modifier 是 Solidity 独有的特性，允许在函数执行前后插入检查逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT&#10;pragma solidity ^0.8.20;&#10;&#10;abstract contract AccessControl {&#10;    mapping(bytes32 =&gt; mapping(address =&gt; bool)) private _roles;&#10;&#10;    bytes32 public constant ADMIN_ROLE = keccak256(&quot;ADMIN_ROLE&quot;);&#10;    bytes32 public constant MINTER_ROLE = keccak256(&quot;MINTER_ROLE&quot;);&#10;&#10;    event RoleGranted(bytes32 indexed role, address indexed account);&#10;    event RoleRevoked(bytes32 indexed role, address indexed account);&#10;&#10;    modifier onlyRole(bytes32 role) {&#10;        require(_roles[role][msg.sender], &quot;AccessControl: unauthorized&quot;);&#10;        _;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    modifier nonReentrant() {&#10;        require(_status != 2, &quot;ReentrancyGuard: reentrant call&quot;);&#10;        _status = 2;&#10;        _;&#10;        _status = 1;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    uint256 private _status = 1;&#10;&#10;    function grantRole(bytes32 role, address account) external onlyRole(ADMIN_ROLE) {&#10;        _roles[role][account] = true;&#10;        emit RoleGranted(role, account);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function revokeRole(bytes32 role, address account) external onlyRole(ADMIN_ROLE) {&#10;        _roles[role][account] = false;&#10;        emit RoleRevoked(role, account);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function hasRole(bytes32 role, address account) public view returns (bool) {&#10;        return _roles[role][account];&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;contract Token is AccessControl {&#10;    string public name;&#10;    string public symbol;&#10;    uint256 public totalSupply;&#10;    mapping(address =&gt; uint256) public balanceOf;&#10;&#10;    constructor(string memory _name, string memory _symbol) {&#10;        name = _name;&#10;        symbol = _symbol;&#10;        _grantInitialRole(ADMIN_ROLE, msg.sender);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function mint(address to, uint256 amount) external onlyRole(MINTER_ROLE) nonReentrant {&#10;        totalSupply += amount;&#10;        balanceOf[to] += amount;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function _grantInitialRole(bytes32 role, address account) internal {&#10;        _roles[role][account] = true;&#10;        emit RoleGranted(role, account);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    mapping(bytes32 =&gt; mapping(address =&gt; bool)) private _roles;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pragma solidity ^0.8.20;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>abstract contract AccessControl {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mapping(bytes32 => mapping(address => bool)) private _roles;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    bytes32 public constant ADMIN_ROLE = keccak256(\"ADMIN_ROLE\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    bytes32 public constant MINTER_ROLE = keccak256(\"MINTER_ROLE\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    event RoleGranted(bytes32 indexed role, address indexed account);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    event RoleRevoked(bytes32 indexed role, address indexed account);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    modifier onlyRole(bytes32 role) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(_roles[role][msg.sender], \"AccessControl: unauthorized\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    modifier nonReentrant() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(_status != 2, \"ReentrancyGuard: reentrant call\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _status = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _status = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint256 private _status = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function grantRole(bytes32 role, address account) external onlyRole(ADMIN_ROLE) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _roles[role][account] = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        emit RoleGranted(role, account);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function revokeRole(bytes32 role, address account) external onlyRole(ADMIN_ROLE) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _roles[role][account] = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        emit RoleRevoked(role, account);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function hasRole(bytes32 role, address account) public view returns (bool) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return _roles[role][account];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract Token is AccessControl {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    string public name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    string public symbol;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint256 public totalSupply;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mapping(address => uint256) public balanceOf;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    constructor(string memory _name, string memory _symbol) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        name = _name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        symbol = _symbol;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _grantInitialRole(ADMIN_ROLE, msg.sender);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function mint(address to, uint256 amount) external onlyRole(MINTER_ROLE) nonReentrant {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        totalSupply += amount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        balanceOf[to] += amount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function _grantInitialRole(bytes32 role, address account) internal {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _roles[role][account] = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        emit RoleGranted(role, account);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mapping(bytes32 => mapping(address => bool)) private _roles;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[外部调用] --&gt; B{可见性检查}&#10;    B --&gt;|public/external| C{modifier 链}&#10;    B --&gt;|internal/private| D[拒绝]&#10;    C --&gt; E[onlyRole 权限检查]&#10;    E --&gt;|通过| F[nonReentrant 重入检查]&#10;    F --&gt;|通过| G[执行函数体]&#10;    G --&gt; H[modifier 后处理]&#10;    E --&gt;|失败| I[revert]&#10;    F --&gt;|失败| I\">graph TD\n    A[外部调用] --&gt; B{可见性检查}\n    B --&gt;|public/external| C{modifier 链}\n    B --&gt;|internal/private| D[拒绝]\n    C --&gt; E[onlyRole 权限检查]\n    E --&gt;|通过| F[nonReentrant 重入检查]\n    F --&gt;|通过| G[执行函数体]\n    G --&gt; H[modifier 后处理]\n    E --&gt;|失败| I[revert]\n    F --&gt;|失败| I</pre><h2 id=\"事件与日志系统\">事件与日志系统</h2><p>事件（Event）是 Solidity 合约与外部世界通信的主要机制。事件数据存储在交易收据的日志中，不占用合约 Storage，Gas 成本相对较低。前端应用通过监听事件来响应链上状态变化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT&#10;pragma solidity ^0.8.20;&#10;&#10;contract EventDrivenDEX {&#10;    event OrderCreated(&#10;        uint256 indexed orderId,&#10;        address indexed maker,&#10;        address tokenIn,&#10;        address tokenOut,&#10;        uint256 amountIn,&#10;        uint256 amountOut&#10;    );&#10;&#10;    event OrderFilled(&#10;        uint256 indexed orderId,&#10;        address indexed taker,&#10;        uint256 filledAmount&#10;    );&#10;&#10;    event OrderCancelled(uint256 indexed orderId);&#10;&#10;    struct Order {&#10;        address maker;&#10;        address tokenIn;&#10;        address tokenOut;&#10;        uint256 amountIn;&#10;        uint256 amountOut;&#10;        uint256 filled;&#10;        bool cancelled;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    uint256 private _nextOrderId;&#10;    mapping(uint256 =&gt; Order) public orders;&#10;&#10;    function createOrder(&#10;        address tokenIn,&#10;        address tokenOut,&#10;        uint256 amountIn,&#10;        uint256 amountOut&#10;    ) external returns (uint256 orderId) {&#10;        orderId = _nextOrderId++;&#10;&#10;        orders[orderId] = Order({&#10;            maker: msg.sender,&#10;            tokenIn: tokenIn,&#10;            tokenOut: tokenOut,&#10;            amountIn: amountIn,&#10;            amountOut: amountOut,&#10;            filled: 0,&#10;            cancelled: false&#10;        });&#10;&#10;        emit OrderCreated(orderId, msg.sender, tokenIn, tokenOut, amountIn, amountOut);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function cancelOrder(uint256 orderId) external {&#10;        Order storage order = orders[orderId];&#10;        require(order.maker == msg.sender, &quot;Not order maker&quot;);&#10;        require(!order.cancelled, &quot;Already cancelled&quot;);&#10;&#10;        order.cancelled = true;&#10;        emit OrderCancelled(orderId);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pragma solidity ^0.8.20;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract EventDrivenDEX {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    event OrderCreated(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 indexed orderId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        address indexed maker,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        address tokenIn,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        address tokenOut,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 amountIn,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 amountOut</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    event OrderFilled(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 indexed orderId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        address indexed taker,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 filledAmount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    event OrderCancelled(uint256 indexed orderId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    struct Order {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        address maker;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        address tokenIn;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        address tokenOut;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 amountIn;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 amountOut;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 filled;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bool cancelled;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint256 private _nextOrderId;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mapping(uint256 => Order) public orders;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function createOrder(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        address tokenIn,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        address tokenOut,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 amountIn,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 amountOut</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) external returns (uint256 orderId) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        orderId = _nextOrderId++;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        orders[orderId] = Order({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            maker: msg.sender,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            tokenIn: tokenIn,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            tokenOut: tokenOut,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            amountIn: amountIn,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            amountOut: amountOut,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            filled: 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            cancelled: false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        emit OrderCreated(orderId, msg.sender, tokenIn, tokenOut, amountIn, amountOut);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function cancelOrder(uint256 orderId) external {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Order storage order = orders[orderId];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(order.maker == msg.sender, \"Not order maker\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(!order.cancelled, \"Already cancelled\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        order.cancelled = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        emit OrderCancelled(orderId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>前端使用 ethers.js 或 viem 监听合约事件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { createPublicClient, http, parseAbiItem } from &#39;viem&#39;;&#10;import { mainnet } from &#39;viem/chains&#39;;&#10;&#10;const client = createPublicClient({&#10;  chain: mainnet,&#10;  transport: http(),&#10;});&#10;&#10;const watchTransfers = async (contractAddress: `0x${string}`) =&gt; {&#10;  const unwatch = client.watchEvent({&#10;    address: contractAddress,&#10;    event: parseAbiItem(&#39;event Transfer(address indexed from, address indexed to, uint256 value)&#39;),&#10;    onLogs: (logs) =&gt; {&#10;      for (const log of logs) {&#10;        const { from, to, value } = log.args;&#10;        console.log(`Transfer: ${from} -&gt; ${to}: ${value}`);&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return unwatch;&#10;};&#10;&#10;const getHistoricalEvents = async (contractAddress: `0x${string}`, fromBlock: bigint, toBlock: bigint) =&gt; {&#10;  const logs = await client.getLogs({&#10;    address: contractAddress,&#10;    event: parseAbiItem(&#10;      &#39;event OrderCreated(uint256 indexed orderId, address indexed maker, address tokenIn, address tokenOut, uint256 amountIn, uint256 amountOut)&#39;,&#10;    ),&#10;    fromBlock,&#10;    toBlock,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return logs.map((log) =&gt; ({&#10;    orderId: log.args.orderId,&#10;    maker: log.args.maker,&#10;    blockNumber: log.blockNumber,&#10;  }));&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createPublicClient, http, parseAbiItem } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'viem'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { mainnet } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'viem/chains'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> client</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createPublicClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#